claude_worklog/final_readiness/v2_full_observation_builder/latest/codex_review/CODEX_REVIEW.md:9:Codex passes the full observation-vector builder at the partial missing-feature burndown scope. The builder honestly preserves the current 26-dim compact runtime observation and builds a separate 1911-slot legacy V3 target surface with explicit missing/source accounting.
claude_worklog/final_readiness/v2_full_observation_builder/latest/codex_review/CODEX_REVIEW.md:11:This is not full observation parity. It does not approve policy architecture parity, checkpoint compatibility, production equivalence, live trading, canary trading, exchange mutation, leverage/margin changes, Redis trim, approval creation, or legacy shutdown.
